msgstr "En la página de %s, desactiva el que no uses."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:314
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugins"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:315
msgid ""
"Send a test from the plugin you kept, then press <b>Send a test email</b> "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Envía una prueba desde el plugin que conservaste y luego pulsa <b>Enviar un "
"correo de prueba</b> aquí."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:327
msgid "Sender › Order emails come from"
msgstr "Remitente › Los correos de pedido vienen de"

#. translators: 1: from domain, 2: store domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:333
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is fine when you own %1$s and its DNS has SPF and DKIM for the service "
"that sends your mail. If not, use an address on %2$s instead."
msgstr ""
"Esto está bien cuando %1$s es tuyo y su DNS tiene SPF y DKIM para el "
"servicio que envía tu correo. Si no, usa en su lugar una dirección en %2$s."

#. translators: %s: free mail domain, e.g. gmail.com
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:336
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Inboxes know %s mail only comes from its own servers, so a receipt from your "
"website that claims to be from that address looks forged."
msgstr ""
"Las bandejas de entrada saben que el correo de %s solo viene de sus propios "
"servidores, así que un recibo de tu sitio web que dice venir de esa "
"dirección parece falsificado."

#. translators: %s: suggested address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:341
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Create a mailbox on your store's domain, for example %s. In cPanel: Email › "
"Email Accounts › Create. In Google Workspace or Microsoft 365, add it as a "
"user or an alias. A forwarder to the inbox you already read is fine."
msgstr ""
"Crea un buzón en el dominio de tu tienda, por ejemplo %s. En cPanel: Email › "
"Email Accounts › Create. En Google Workspace o Microsoft 365, añádelo como "
"usuario o alias. Un reenviador a la bandeja que ya lees también sirve."

#. translators: %s: link to the from address setting
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:343
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the new address in %s and save."
msgstr "Introduce la nueva dirección en %s y guarda."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:344
msgid ""
"If a mail plugin is connected to Gmail or Outlook, update its from address "
"too."
msgstr ""
"Si un plugin de correo está conectado a Gmail o Outlook, actualiza también "
"su dirección de origen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:347
msgid "Suggested address"
msgstr "Dirección sugerida"

#. translators: %s: sending service name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:360
#, php-format
msgid "Sending with %s?"
msgstr "¿Envías con %s?"

#. translators: 1: service name, 2: SPF include
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your SPF record does not mention %1$s. Many services only need their DKIM "
"records, but if their domain setup asks for SPF, edit your existing record "
"so it includes %2$s:"
msgstr ""
"Tu registro SPF no menciona %1$s. Muchos servicios solo necesitan sus "
"registros DKIM, pero si la configuración de su dominio pide SPF, edita tu "
"registro existente para que incluya %2$s:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:375
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:434
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:455
msgid "Name / host"
msgstr "Nombre / host"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:379
msgid ""
"Edit the record you already have. A domain may only have one SPF record; a "
"second one breaks both."
msgstr ""
"Edita el registro que ya tienes. Un dominio solo puede tener un registro "
"SPF; un segundo registro rompe ambos."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:388
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It says your web server, your mail server and your "
"sending service may send email for the domain."
msgstr ""
"Añade este registro a %s. Indica que tu servidor web, tu servidor de correo "
"y tu servicio de envío pueden enviar correo en nombre del dominio."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:393
#, php-format
msgid "Name / host (@ means %s)"
msgstr "Nombre / host (@ significa %s)"

#. translators: %s: service name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:399
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This already includes %s, which looks like the service sending your mail."
msgstr "Esto ya incluye %s, que parece ser el servicio que envía tu correo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:407
msgid ""
"Send through a service or a hosted mailbox? Add its include just before "
"<code>~all</code>:"
msgstr ""
"¿Envías a través de un servicio o un buzón alojado? Añade su include justo "
"antes de <code>~all</code>:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:409
msgid ""
"Already have a TXT record starting with <code>v=spf1</code>? Edit that one "
"instead. A domain may only have one SPF record."
msgstr ""
"¿Ya tienes un registro TXT que empieza por <code>v=spf1</code>? Edita ese en "
"su lugar. Un dominio solo puede tener un registro SPF."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:420
msgid ""
"DKIM records hold a unique key, so you copy them from whoever sends your "
"email rather than typing one yourself. Get it here:"
msgstr ""
"Los registros DKIM contienen una clave única, así que los copias de quien "
"envía tu correo en lugar de escribir uno tú mismo. Consíguelo aquí:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:423
msgid "(looks like yours):"
msgstr "(parece el tuyo):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid "Email with your web host (cPanel):"
msgstr "Correo con tu proveedor de alojamiento web (cPanel):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid ""
"Email › Email Deliverability › Manage next to your domain. If your DNS is at "
"the same host, press \"Install the suggested record\"."
msgstr ""
"Email › Email Deliverability › Manage junto a tu dominio. Si tu DNS está en "
"el mismo proveedor, pulsa \"Install the suggested record\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:426
msgid "Add the record, wait an hour, then press \"Start authentication\"."
msgstr ""
"Añade el registro, espera una hora y luego pulsa \"Start authentication\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:427
msgid "Add the two CNAME records it shows, then turn signing on."
msgstr "Añade los dos registros CNAME que se muestran y luego activa la firma."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:428
msgid "Sending services (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark):"
msgstr "Servicios de envío (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:428
msgid ""
"look for \"Domain authentication\" or \"Verify domain\". They list two or "
"three records to add."
msgstr ""
"busca \"Domain authentication\" o \"Verify domain\". Indican dos o tres "
"registros para añadir."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:430
msgid "The record you add looks like this:"
msgstr "El registro que añades tiene este aspecto:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:433
msgid "TXT or CNAME (as given)"
msgstr "TXT o CNAME (según se indique)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:435
msgid "the long text from your provider"
msgstr "el texto largo de tu proveedor"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:438
msgid ""
"We look for common selector names (default, google, selector1, k1, s1…). If "
"your provider uses a different name, DKIM may already work even though this "
"still shows a warning."
msgstr ""
"Buscamos nombres de selector habituales (default, google, selector1, k1, "
"s1…). Si tu proveedor usa un nombre distinto, DKIM puede que ya funcione "
"aunque esto siga mostrando una advertencia."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:451
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It only watches: it never blocks your mail, and it "
"sends you reports on who is sending as your domain."
msgstr ""
"Añade este registro a %s. Solo observa: nunca bloquea tu correo y te envía "
"informes sobre quién envía en nombre de tu dominio."

#. translators: 1: full record name, 2: report address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:460
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some DNS hosts want the full name, %1$s. Reports go to %2$s; change it to "
"any mailbox you read."
msgstr ""
"Algunos proveedores de DNS piden el nombre completo, %1$s. Los informes se "
"envían a %2$s; cámbialo a cualquier buzón que leas."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:461
msgid ""
"Set up SPF and DKIM first. After a few weeks of clean reports you can change "
"<code>p=none</code> to <code>p=quarantine</code> for extra protection."
msgstr ""
"Configura primero SPF y DKIM. Después de unas semanas de informes limpios "
"puedes cambiar <code>p=none</code> por <code>p=quarantine</code> para mayor "
"protección."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:468
msgid "How to check another way"
msgstr "Cómo comprobarlo de otra forma"

#. translators: %s: link to Google Admin Toolbox
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:473
#, php-format
msgid "Open %s, enter your domain and read the SPF, DKIM and DMARC results."
msgstr ""
"Abre %s, introduce tu dominio y lee los resultados de SPF, DKIM y DMARC."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:473
msgid "Google Admin Toolbox Check MX"
msgstr "Google Admin Toolbox Check MX"

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:475
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Or ask your host: \"Please confirm SPF, DKIM and DMARC are set up for %s.\""
msgstr ""
"O pregunta a tu proveedor: \"Por favor, confirma que SPF, DKIM y DMARC están "
"configurados para %s.\""

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:487
msgid ""
"Ask your host whether outgoing SMTP is allowed, and on which port (587 is "
"the usual one)."
msgstr ""
"Pregunta a tu proveedor si se permite SMTP saliente y en qué puerto (587 es "
"el habitual)."

#. translators: %s: link to the Send method setting
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:489
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Or avoid the blocked port: set %s to WordPress mail and use a mail plugin "
"that connects over an API (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark). "
"APIs use the normal web port, which hosts do not block."
msgstr ""
"O evita el puerto bloqueado: define %s como Correo de WordPress y usa un "
"plugin de correo que se conecte mediante una API (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, "
"Amazon SES, Postmark). Las API usan el puerto web normal, que los "
"proveedores no bloquean."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:489
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:580
msgid "Send method"
msgstr "Método de envío"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:503
msgid ""
"Sign up for a sending service built for store email (Brevo, SendGrid, "
"Mailgun, Amazon SES or Postmark). Most have a free or low-cost plan."
msgstr ""
"Date de alta en un servicio de envío pensado para el correo de tiendas "
"(Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES o Postmark). La mayoría tiene un plan "
"gratuito o de bajo coste."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:504
msgid ""
"Verify your domain with them: they give you DNS records that also take care "
"of SPF and DKIM."
msgstr ""
"Verifica tu dominio con ellos: te dan registros DNS que también se encargan "
"de SPF y DKIM."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:505
msgid ""
"Paste their API key into your mail plugin, choosing that service instead of "
"Gmail, and send a test."
msgstr ""
"Pega su clave de API en tu plugin de correo, eligiendo ese servicio en lugar "
"de Gmail, y envía una prueba."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:581
msgid "cPanel › Domains › Zone Editor › Manage › Add Record"
msgstr "cPanel › Dominios › Editor de zona › Administrar › Añadir registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:583
msgid ""
"Cloudflare dashboard › your domain › DNS › Records › Add record. Leave "
"\"Proxy\" off for email records."
msgstr ""
"Panel de Cloudflare › tu dominio › DNS › Registros › Añadir registro. Deja "
"\"Proxy\" desactivado para los registros de correo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:584
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:585
msgid "GoDaddy › My Products › your domain › DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "GoDaddy › Mis productos › tu dominio › DNS › Añadir nuevo registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:586
msgid "Namecheap › Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "Namecheap › Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS › Add New Record"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:587
msgid "SiteGround Site Tools › Domain › DNS Zone Editor"
msgstr "SiteGround Site Tools › Dominio › Editor de zona DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:590
msgid "Bluehost › Domains › your domain › DNS"
msgstr "Bluehost › Dominios › tu dominio › DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:593
msgid "Hostinger hPanel › Domains › your domain › DNS / Nameservers"
msgstr "Hostinger hPanel › Dominios › tu dominio › DNS / Servidores de nombres"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:594
msgid "AWS console › Route 53 › Hosted zones › your domain › Create record"
msgstr ""
"Consola de AWS › Route 53 › Zonas alojadas › tu dominio › Crear registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:596
msgid "IONOS › Domains & SSL › your domain › DNS › Add record"
msgstr "IONOS › Dominios y SSL › tu dominio › DNS › Añadir registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:597
msgid "WordPress.com › Upgrades › Domains › your domain › DNS records"
msgstr "WordPress.com › Mejoras › Dominios › tu dominio › Registros DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:598
msgid "Wix › Domains › your domain › Manage DNS records"
msgstr "Wix › Dominios › tu dominio › Administrar registros DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:599
msgid "DigitalOcean › Networking › Domains › your domain"
msgstr "DigitalOcean › Networking › Domains › tu dominio"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:623
msgid "Where to add it"
msgstr "Dónde añadirlo"

#. translators: 1: DNS provider name, 2: nameserver
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:627
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The DNS for this domain looks like it is managed at %1$s (nameserver %2$s)."
msgstr ""
"El DNS de este dominio parece estar gestionado en %1$s (servidor de nombres "
"%2$s)."

#. translators: 1: domain, 2: nameserver
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:630
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The DNS for %1$s is run by the company behind its nameserver, %2$s. That is "
"usually your web host or where you bought the domain; log in there and look "
"for DNS, Zone Editor or Advanced DNS."
msgstr ""
"El DNS de %1$s lo gestiona la empresa detrás de su servidor de nombres, "
"%2$s. Normalmente es tu proveedor de alojamiento web o donde compraste el "
"dominio; inicia sesión allí y busca DNS, Zone Editor o Advanced DNS."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:633
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the DNS settings for %s: usually where you bought the domain, or your web "
"host if the domain points there."
msgstr ""
"En los ajustes de DNS de %s: normalmente donde compraste el dominio, o tu "
"proveedor de alojamiento web si el dominio apunta allí."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:636
msgid "DNS › Records › Add record"
msgstr "DNS › Registros › Añadir registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:637
msgid "Domains › Zone Editor › Manage › Add Record"
msgstr "Dominios › Editor de zona › Administrar › Añadir registro"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:638
msgid "My Products › DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "My Products › DNS › Add New Record"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:639
msgid "Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS"
msgstr "Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:641
msgid ""
"New records usually show up within an hour (occasionally up to 48 hours). "
"Then run the checks again."
msgstr ""
"Los registros nuevos suelen aparecer en una hora (a veces hasta 48 horas). "
"Después, ejecuta las comprobaciones de nuevo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:674
msgid "Installed, not turned on"
msgstr "Instalado, no activado"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:674
msgid "To do"
msgstr "Por hacer"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:677
msgid "Improve delivery in 3 steps"
msgstr "Mejora la entrega en 3 pasos"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:677
msgid "About 15 minutes · free"
msgstr "Unos 15 minutos · gratis"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:678
msgid ""
"Right now your store emails leave through your web server's basic mail, "
"which inboxes often send to spam. A free mail plugin connects your store to "
"a real mailbox or sending service so receipts, order updates and password "
"emails arrive."
msgstr ""
"Ahora mismo los correos de tu tienda salen por el correo básico de tu "
"servidor web, que las bandejas de entrada suelen enviar a spam. Un plugin de "
"correo gratuito conecta tu tienda a un buzón real o a un servicio de envío "
"para que lleguen los recibos, las actualizaciones de pedidos y los correos "
"de contraseña."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:683
msgid "Install a free mail plugin"
msgstr "Instala un plugin de correo gratuito"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:684
msgid ""
"We suggest WP Mail SMTP or FluentSMTP. Both are free, widely used, and have "
"a setup wizard that asks simple questions."
msgstr ""
"Te sugerimos WP Mail SMTP o FluentSMTP. Ambos son gratuitos, muy usados y "
"tienen un asistente de configuración con preguntas sencillas."

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:689
#, php-format
msgid "Turn on %s"
msgstr "Activar %s"

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:699
#, php-format
msgid "Find %s"
msgstr "Buscar %s"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:703
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:734
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:782
msgid "Show me how"
msgstr "Muéstrame cómo"

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:708
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Press <b>Turn on %s</b>. It opens the Plugins page filtered to that plugin."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa <b>Activar %s</b>. Abre la página de Plugins filtrada por ese plugin."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:709
msgid "Press <b>Activate</b> under the plugin name."
msgstr "Pulsa <b>Activar</b> bajo el nombre del plugin."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:710
msgid ""
"The plugin opens its setup wizard or settings. Keep this page open in "
"another tab so you can come back."
msgstr ""
"El plugin abre su asistente de configuración o sus ajustes. Mantén esta "
"página abierta en otra pestaña para poder volver."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:714
msgid ""
"Press <b>Find WP Mail SMTP</b> (or FluentSMTP). It opens Plugins › Add New "
"with the search filled in."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa <b>Buscar WP Mail SMTP</b> (o FluentSMTP). Abre Plugins › Añadir nuevo "
"con la búsqueda ya rellenada."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:715
msgid ""
"Press <b>Install Now</b> on the plugin card, wait a moment, then press "
"<b>Activate</b>."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa <b>Instalar ahora</b> en la tarjeta del plugin, espera un momento y "
"luego pulsa <b>Activar</b>."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:716
msgid ""
"The plugin opens its setup wizard. Keep this page open in another tab so you "
"can come back."
msgstr ""
"El plugin abre su asistente de configuración. Mantén esta página abierta en "
"otra pestaña para poder volver."

#. translators: %s: link to the Send method setting
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:721
#, php-format
msgid ""
"EasyCart is set to its built-in mailer, which skips mail plugins. Set %s to "
"WordPress mail."
msgstr ""
"EasyCart está configurado con su sistema de envío integrado, que omite los "
"plugins de correo. Define %s como Correo de WordPress."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:725
msgid ""
"Your account cannot install plugins. Ask whoever manages this site to "
"install WP Mail SMTP or FluentSMTP."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta no puede instalar plugins. Pide a quien gestione este sitio que "
"instale WP Mail SMTP o FluentSMTP."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:731
msgid "Connect it to your email"
msgstr "Conéctalo a tu correo"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:731
msgid "After step 1"
msgstr "Después del paso 1"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:732
msgid ""
"The plugin needs an account to send from. Use the mailbox you already have, "
"or a sending service if your store sends a lot."
msgstr ""
"El plugin necesita una cuenta desde la que enviar. Usa el buzón que ya "
"tienes, o un servicio de envío si tu tienda envía mucho correo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:738
msgid "Email with your web host (cPanel)"
msgstr "Correo con tu proveedor de alojamiento web (cPanel)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:739
msgid "In the plugin choose <b>Other SMTP</b> and enter:"
msgstr "En el plugin, elige <b>Other SMTP</b> e introduce:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:742
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:735
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:1047
msgid "SMTP host"
msgstr "Host SMTP"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:743
msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Puerto y cifrado"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:743
msgid "465 with SSL, or 587 with TLS"
msgstr "465 con SSL, o 587 con TLS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:744
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Nombre de usuario"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:744
msgid "your full email address"
msgstr "tu dirección de correo completa"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:745
msgid "that mailbox's password"
msgstr "la contraseña de ese buzón"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:748
msgid "Exact values are in cPanel › Email › Email Accounts › Connect Devices."
msgstr ""
"Los valores exactos están en cPanel › Email › Email Accounts › Connect "
"Devices."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:751
msgid "Google Workspace or Gmail"
msgstr "Google Workspace o Gmail"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:752
msgid ""
"Choose the plugin's <b>Google / Gmail</b> option and sign in with Google. "
"Gmail limits how many emails you can send a day, so busy stores should use a "
"sending service."
msgstr ""
"Elige la opción <b>Google / Gmail</b> del plugin e inicia sesión con Google. "
"Gmail limita cuántos correos puedes enviar al día, así que las tiendas con "
"mucho tráfico deberían usar un servicio de envío."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:755
msgid "Microsoft 365 or Outlook"
msgstr "Microsoft 365 u Outlook"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:756
msgid ""
"Choose the plugin's <b>Microsoft / Outlook</b> option and sign in with "
"Microsoft. Microsoft is turning off password-only SMTP, so the sign-in "
"option is the one that keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Elige la opción <b>Microsoft / Outlook</b> del plugin e inicia sesión con "
"Microsoft. Microsoft está desactivando el SMTP solo con contraseña, así que "
"la opción de inicio de sesión es la que sigue funcionando."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:759
msgid "A sending service (most reliable)"
msgstr "Un servicio de envío (el más fiable)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:760
msgid ""
"Sign up with Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES or Postmark. Verify your "
"domain (they give you DNS records, which also fixes SPF and DKIM), create an "
"API key, pick that service in the plugin and paste the key."
msgstr ""
"Date de alta en Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES o Postmark. Verifica tu "
"dominio (te dan registros DNS que también solucionan SPF y DKIM), crea una "
"clave de API, elige ese servicio en el plugin y pega la clave."

#. translators: %s: from address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:766
#, php-format
msgid "Whichever you choose, send from the same address EasyCart uses: %s."
msgstr ""
"Elijas lo que elijas, envía desde la misma dirección que usa EasyCart: %s."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:773
msgid "Send a test, then run the checks again"
msgstr "Envía una prueba y luego ejecuta las comprobaciones de nuevo"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:773
msgid "After step 2"
msgstr "Después del paso 2"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:774
msgid ""
"Once the plugin reports a successful test, send one from EasyCart too. When "
"the checks see the plugin, this guide is replaced by a green \"Your emails "
"are sent by…\" check."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el plugin informe de una prueba correcta, envía también una desde "
"EasyCart. Cuando las comprobaciones detecten el plugin, esta guía se "
"sustituye por una comprobación verde de \"Tus correos los envía…\"."

#. translators: 1: date, 2: result, 3: transport
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:777
#, php-format
msgid "Last test: %1$s · %2$s · %3$s"
msgstr "Última prueba: %1$s · %2$s · %3$s"

