"Named methods the shopper picks from at checkout, each with its own price"
msgstr ""
"Métodos con nombre que el comprador elige al finalizar la compra, cada uno "
"con su propio precio"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:58
msgid ""
"Every method listed here is offered, in the order you set. A method with a "
"free-shipping threshold becomes free once the cart total reaches it."
msgstr ""
"Se ofrecen todos los métodos indicados aquí, en el orden que establezcas. Un "
"método con un umbral de envío gratuito pasa a ser gratis en cuanto el total "
"del carrito lo alcanza."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:64
msgid "One rate, chosen by how much the shopper is spending"
msgstr "Una tarifa, elegida según cuánto gasta el comprador"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:66
msgid ""
"The row whose “from” amount is the highest one at or below the cart total "
"applies. Start a row at 0 so every order gets a rate."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica la fila cuyo importe “desde” sea el mayor que no supere el total "
"del carrito. Empieza una fila en 0 para que todos los pedidos tengan una "
"tarifa."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:72
msgid "One rate, chosen by the total weight of the order"
msgstr "Una tarifa, elegida según el peso total del pedido"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:74
msgid ""
"Weights use the unit your products are entered in. The row whose “from” "
"weight is the highest one at or below the order weight applies."
msgstr ""
"Los pesos utilizan la unidad en la que se introducen tus productos. Se "
"aplica la fila cuyo peso “desde” sea el mayor que no supere el peso del "
"pedido."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:79
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:101
msgid "By quantity"
msgstr "Por cantidad"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:80
msgid "One rate, chosen by how many items are in the cart"
msgstr "Una tarifa, elegida según cuántos artículos hay en el carrito"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:82
msgid ""
"The row whose “from” count is the highest one at or below the number of "
"items applies."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica la fila cuya cantidad “desde” sea la mayor que no supere el número "
"de artículos."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:87
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:102
msgid "Percentage of total"
msgstr "Porcentaje del total"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:88
msgid "Shipping charged as a share of the cart total"
msgstr "Envío cobrado como un porcentaje del total del carrito"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_shipping_rates_v2.php:90
msgid ""
"The row whose “from” amount is the highest one at or below the cart total "
"sets the percentage charged."
msgstr ""
"La fila cuyo importe “desde” sea el mayor que no supere el total del carrito "
"determina el porcentaje cobrado."

